@base = http://localhost:8080
@userToken = PEGAR_ACCESS_TOKEN_USER
@adminToken = PEGAR_ACCESS_TOKEN_ADMIN
@id = PEGAR_UUID

### Registro público (201)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Ana","email":"ana@example.com","password":"UnaClaveLarga123!"}

### Login USER (200). Copia accessToken a userToken.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"ana@example.com","password":"UnaClaveLarga123!"}

### Cuenta propia (200)
GET {{base}}/api/usuarios/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Login ADMIN. Sustituye la contraseña configurada y copia accessToken.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@example.com","password":"REEMPLAZAR_CON_PASSWORD_ADMIN"}

### Crear usuario (201). Copia id a la variable id.
POST {{base}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Pedro","email":"pedro@example.com","password":"OtraClaveLarga456!","role":"USER"}

### Lista paginada (200)
GET {{base}}/api/usuarios?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Consulta (200)
GET {{base}}/api/usuarios/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Actualización (200)
PUT {{base}}/api/usuarios/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Pedro Actualizado","email":"pedro.nuevo@example.com"}

### Eliminación (204)
DELETE {{base}}/api/usuarios/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Sin autenticación (401)
GET {{base}}/api/usuarios

### USER intenta listar (403)
GET {{base}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Registro intenta asignar ADMIN (400)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Ataque","email":"otro@example.com","password":"UnaClaveLarga123!","role":"ADMIN"}
